 and millions more can be saved from quantum attack, says expert\", \"age_h\": 13.1, \"published\": \"2026-05-21T19:10:03+00:00\", \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2026/05/21/satoshi-s-1-1m-bitcoin-stash-can-be-saved-from-quantum-attack-says-americanfortress\", \"desc\": \"Researchers at the privacy-centric blockchain startup say their multi-layer quantum defense will feature a soft fork to freeze and protect dormant BTC.\"}\n{\"title\": \"Mark Cuban says he sold most of his Bitcoin after failed hedge narrative 'disappointed' the billionaire\", \"age_h\": 14.8, \"published\": \"2026-05-21T17:30:16+00:00\", \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/21/mark-cuban-says-he-sold-most-of-his-bitcoin-after-failed-hedge-narrative-disappointed-the-billionaire\", \"desc\": \"The billionaire investor said he sold most of his bitcoin after concluding the cryptocurrency failed to act as a hedge during recent geopolitical turmoil and do\"}\n{\"title\": \"Ethereum’s identity crisis is deepening after high-profile 'brain drain' frustrates the community\", \"age_h\": 15.3, \"published\": \"2026-05-21T16:56:33+00:00\", \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2026/05/21/ethereum-s-identity-crisis-is-deepening-after-high-profile-brain-drain-frustrates-the-community\", \"desc\": \"What began earlier this week as shock over more exits of core figures has now evolved into something more existential, according to some community members.\"}\n{\"title\": \"Crypto prediction markets are turning into dangerous national security risks, and Congress wants to ban them\", \"age_h\": 16.6, \"published\": \"2026-05-21T15:38:47+00:00\", \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/05/21/crypto-prediction-markets-are-turning-into-dangerous-national-security-risks-and-congress-wants-to-ban-them\", \"desc\": \"Bubblemaps investigators led by Nicolas Vaiman, discovered 80 bets on Polymarket with a 98% win rate that he said is statistically impossible to achieve.\"}\n{\"title\"